  "job_B19.2.1_20251003_114441": {
    "chunk_text": "JU24A11 he com beforan Criste on middangeard, swa se morgensteorra cym\u00f0 beforan \u00fe\u00e6re sunnan, JU24A15 Johannes w\u00e6s se engel se \u00f0e eode beforan gode, for\u00fean \u00f0e god wolde \u00fea for\u00f0gangan on JU24A17 \u00dey syxtan mon\u00f0e Johannes fahnode on hys modor ynno\u00f0e, \u00fea sancta Maria eode in to hys JU24A20 Myd \u00fey he getacnode Crist cumenne in \u00fe\u00e6re cl\u00e6nan f\u00e6mnan ynno\u00f0. JU24A21 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s hr\u00e6d \u00e6rendraca, se tylode to secganne hys \u00e6rndunge \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee he lyfde. JU24A23 Ne genyhtsuma\u00f0 \u00e6nygum men to asecganne \u00fe\u00e6s acennedan engles m\u00e6gen Johannes. JU24B1 On \u00feone ylcan d\u00e6g by\u00f0 solstitia, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on ure ge\u00feeode sungihte, for\u00feon \u00f0e seo sunne stande\u00f0 JU24B3 \u00deonne gelympe\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wundorlice on \u00fe\u00e6s sumeres sungihte on mydne d\u00e6g. JU24B7 \u00deonne seo sunne by\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6s heofones mydle, \u00feonne nafa\u00f0 seo syl n\u00e6nige sceade. JU24B10 \u00deonne \u00fe\u00e6s sungihtes beo\u00f0 \u00fery dagas for\u00f0 aurnen, ond se d\u00e6g by\u00f0 hwene scyrtra, \u00feonne JU24B13 Ond swa \u00fea dagas for\u00f0 onsceortia\u00f0, swa by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re syle sceade lengra. JU24B15 \u00deeos syl cy\u00fee\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Hierusalem seo ceaster ys geseted on myddre eor\u00f0an, ond heo ys cweden JU25A1 On \u00feone fif ond",
